952
00:39:29,408 --> 00:39:30,368
Uh, but...

953
00:39:31,243 --> 00:39:32,161
Here we are now.

954
00:39:32,244 --> 00:39:34,205
She's amazing. 
She compliments me perfectly. 

955
00:39:34,288 --> 00:39:36,874
We're building an amazing life together.
I love you so much.

956
00:39:36,957 --> 00:39:38,834
[Christine] Oh, thank you. I love you.

957
00:39:38,918 --> 00:39:41,670
Cheers for Christine and Christian!

958
00:39:41,754 --> 00:39:43,214
Cheers!

959
00:39:43,297 --> 00:39:45,883
-[Maya] Christine and Christian.
-Cheers!

960
00:39:45,966 --> 00:39:47,551
-Love you.
-Love you, too.

961
00:39:48,177 --> 00:39:49,595
[Romain] Season... Game one.

962
00:39:49,678 --> 00:39:51,889
[Jason] Fucking Barcelona.
It's the easiest team to like.

963
00:39:52,348 --> 00:39:53,891
[Davina] Excuse me, gentlemen.

964
00:39:54,392 --> 00:39:56,018
Could I talk to Mr. Romain?

965
00:39:56,102 --> 00:39:57,186
Yeah, please.

966
00:39:57,269 --> 00:39:59,271
-[Brett] Go ahead.
-[Davina laughing] Thank you.

967
00:39:59,605 --> 00:40:00,773
-Hi.
-Hey.

968
00:40:00,898 --> 00:40:02,316
-How are you?
-Good, and you?

969
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:03,317
Good.

970
00:40:04,068 --> 00:40:08,030
So, um... obviously I heard that
you don't want me at your wedding

971
00:40:08,114 --> 00:40:10,991
and Mary kind of explained to me
how you feel a little,

972
00:40:11,075 --> 00:40:13,494
but I wanted to talk to you directly.

973
00:40:13,577 --> 00:40:15,788
Because if your feelings are hurt

974
00:40:15,871 --> 00:40:18,582
and you feel offended by me,
I wanna know that.

975
00:40:18,666 --> 00:40:22,169
The point is, it's not even 
like telling you, yet...

976
00:40:22,628 --> 00:40:24,505
Yeah, I could have told you.

977
00:40:24,755 --> 00:40:26,715
-The point is whatever you said--
-Well, it is.

978
00:40:26,799 --> 00:40:29,009
-Whatever you--
-Because it's humiliating.

979
00:40:29,093 --> 00:40:31,720
First of all,
the whole entire office knows.

980
00:40:31,804 --> 00:40:34,140
And it puts our...
Forget about my feelings,

981
00:40:34,223 --> 00:40:36,100
it puts all of our friends 
in a bad position.

982
00:40:36,183 --> 00:40:37,560
-[Romain] Is Mary your friend?
-Yes.

983
00:40:37,643 --> 00:40:41,063
Okay, so when I got her a ring,
it doesn't fucking matter what I got.

984
00:40:41,605 --> 00:40:44,358
-It could have been a rubber band...
-Wait, rewind.

985
00:40:44,442 --> 00:40:47,027
When you said, "I'd have nothing
than a fake diamond..."

986
00:40:47,111 --> 00:40:48,696
I wanna hear what you're saying, Romain.

987
00:40:48,779 --> 00:40:51,323
I just think,
if you call Mary your friend,

988
00:40:51,407 --> 00:40:53,451
you should never have a comment like that.

989
00:40:53,534 --> 00:40:55,286
-That's fucking bullshit.
-Okay.

990
00:40:55,369 --> 00:40:57,371
-If it's fucking bullshit...
-Yeah, it is.

991
00:40:57,455 --> 00:40:59,957
...then why did you get a real diamond,
if it's bullshit?

992
00:41:00,040 --> 00:41:01,500
I told her when I gave her the ring,

993
00:41:01,584 --> 00:41:06,172
I say, "You deserve a diamond and
at some point I will get you a diamond,

994
00:41:06,255 --> 00:41:09,508
the right ring you deserve."
And then what happened, I can afford it--

995
00:41:09,592 --> 00:41:11,719
Do you think it was
a sensitive situation for you,

996
00:41:11,802 --> 00:41:14,680
and maybe you took it 
a little bit too serious?

997
00:41:14,763 --> 00:41:16,432
-You're full of shit.
-Okay.

998
00:41:16,515 --> 00:41:17,558
Alright.

999
00:41:17,975 --> 00:41:20,186
I didn't know he was
this fucking hypersensitive.

1000
00:41:20,269 --> 00:41:21,937
To get in my face, a year later,

1001
00:41:22,021 --> 00:41:24,315
be this fired up. If you know 
that what I said is wrong,

1002
00:41:24,398 --> 00:41:26,150
why is it piercing at you so much?

1003
00:41:26,233 --> 00:41:29,361
So, Chrishell made a comment 
about a prenup.

1004
00:41:29,445 --> 00:41:30,738
-Yeah.
-And that's fine?

1005
00:41:31,155 --> 00:41:35,826
Yeah, and you... So, when Chrishell
asked you a question about us,

1006
00:41:35,910 --> 00:41:39,205
she knew us,
or at least she knew Mary, right?

1007
00:41:40,331 --> 00:41:44,126
If you're really her friend, then you know
she doesn't spend a cent for me.

1008
00:41:44,210 --> 00:41:47,171
Every time we go out, 
I pay everything for both of us.

1009
00:41:47,254 --> 00:41:51,425
When you say to Chrishell, "Oh, yes,
she's paying everything for him,

1010
00:41:51,509 --> 00:41:52,760
and I hope she makes a prenup,"

1011
00:41:52,843 --> 00:41:55,221
that's fucking bullshit. 
If you don't know the person,

1012
00:41:55,304 --> 00:41:58,140
you shut the fuck up and you don't 
make any comment like that, okay?

1013
00:41:58,224 --> 00:41:59,892
Let's just be clear. Now we're good.

1014
00:41:59,975 --> 00:42:00,893
Wow.

1015
00:42:05,522 --> 00:42:06,524
Okay.

1016
00:42:08,275 --> 00:42:11,153
[Mary] Oh, you're still alive. 
Is Davina alive?

1017
00:42:11,654 --> 00:42:12,571
I don't know.

